 "sprite_review": {
  "score": 4.0,
  "problems": [
   "Scale is wrong. In the 'next to a person' and 'wide' frames the cone is only about as tall as the person (around 1.1x his height). The brief asks for scenery much taller than a person, and this reads as a knee-high model or a mound.",
   "There is no smoke. The brief says 'a smoking volcano', and nothing rises from the crater, so the main feature is missing.",
   "The streaks down the flanks are pale white or silver, so they read as waterfalls or snow streams, not lava or brushed-steel ridges. It looks like a wet rocky hill.",
   "The green-yellow grass tufts and shrubs around the base don't belong on the moon and are outside the house palette (charcoal, brushed metal, gold).",
   "The gold rim from the spec is missing. The crater lip is plain grey rock."
  ]
 }
